 "Oh my God! Are you okay?"}, {"start": 540.38, "end": 541.38, "text": "Barely felt it."}, {"start": 541.38, "end": 542.38, "text": "Well, let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 542.38, "end": 543.38, "text": "Britt is in the bathroom."}, {"start": 547.98, "end": 549.38, "text": "Oh no, what happened?"}, {"start": 549.38, "end": 550.38, "text": "A minor head wound."}, {"start": 550.38, "end": 552.82, "text": "If there's an abrasion, we'll clean it with iodine and apply ice."}, {"start": 552.82, "end": 554.18, "text": "You make a good nurse."}, {"start": 554.18, "end": 554.98, "text": "Thanks."}, {"start": 554.98, "end": 557.18, "text": "Dr. Shirley says mini pies are the best medicine."}, {"start": 557.18, "end": 559.9, "text": "Then I'd like to see her degree."}, {"start": 559.9, "end": 562.5, "text": "He's butting antlers with you because you're a threat now."}, {"start": 562.5, "end": 563.74, "text": "You've got your own place."}, {"start": 563.74, "end": 565.18, "text": "You've got a future."}, {"start": 565.18, "end": 568.9, "text": "You've got a bowl full of olives next to the toilet."}, {"start": 568.9, "end": 570.82, "text": "It's a fancy party, Britta."}, {"start": 570.82, "end": 573.42, "text": "You know what Jeff has in his bathroom?"}, {"start": 573.42, "end": 576.74, "text": "Neither do I. He keeps his toiletries in a safe"}, {"start": 576.74, "end": 578.38, "text": "under the sink."}, {"start": 578.38, "end": 581.72, "text": "His whole personality is based around guarding himself."}, {"start": 581.72, "end": 583.72, "text": "You don't have to be like that to be a man."}, {"start": 586.52, "end": 589.02, "text": "You're really cool, Alberta."}, {"start": 589.02, "end": 592.02, "text": "Man, pizza guys are getting worse and worse looking."}, {"start": 592.02, "end": 594.36, "text": "I guess all the good ones went into porn."}, {"start": 594.36, "end": 595.36, "text": "Ceiling fan."}, {"start": 595.36, "end": 596.74, "text": "I miss all the fun."}, {"start": 596.74, "end": 598.4, "text": "I wonder what would happen in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 598.4, "end": 599.4, "text": "Who cares?"}, {"start": 599.4, "end": 600.4, "text": "Who cares?"}, {"start": 602.4, "end": 603.4, "text": "( grunts )"}, {"start": 603.4, "end": 604.7, "text": "( laughs )"}, {"start": 604.7, "end": 606.7, "text": "( buzzer )"}, {"start": 606.7, "end": 611.04, "text": "Ah, okay. Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 611.04, "end": 613.2, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 613.2, "end": 614.7, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 619.2, "end": 621.7, "text": "Six. One, two, three, four, five, six, Britta."}, {"start": 621.7, "end": 622.7, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 622.7, "end": 624.7, "text": "Great. You know, it's great."}, {"start": 624.7, "end": 628.7, "text": "Air travel. I've flown a lot. A lot of airplane stories."}, {"start": 628.7, "end": 630.2, "text": "I once had sex with Eartha Kid."}, {"start": 630.2, "end": 632.2, "text": "Okay, I'm gonna tickle my pies."}, {"start": 636.7, "end": 637.54, "text": "- Right."}, {"start": 638.7, "end": 641.54, "text": "- You guys are my best. - I'm not gonna drink."}, {"start": 641.54, "end": 642.38, "text": "(grunting)"}, {"start": 642.38, "end": 643.22, "text": "- Oh my god."}, {"start": 643.22, "end": 644.04, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 644.04, "end": 644.88, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 644.88, "end": 645.72, "text": "- Barely felt it."}, {"start": 645.72, "end": 647.46, "text": "- Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 649.46, "end": 651.18, "text": "- Did that mean to refill the toilet dollars?"}, {"start": 651.18, "end": 652.14, "text": "- We're good, I checked."}, {"start": 652.14, "end": 652.98, "text": "- You're the best."}, {"start": 652.98, "end": 654.14, "text": "- Want to stay up all night talking to our bunk beds?"}, {"start": 654.14, "end": 655.58, "text": "- Do do."}, {"start": 655.58, "end": 658.26, "text": "Here Troy, happy housewarming."}, {"start": 658.26, "end": 660.6, "text": "Oh, cool, thanks Pierce."}, {"start": 661.94, "end": 663.58, "text": "You make a good nurse, Annie."}, {"start": 663.58, "end": 665.1, "text": "- Thank you."}, {"start": 665.1, "end": 667.94, "text": "I actually had to apply a tourniquet the other day."}, {"start": 667.94, "end": 669.86, "text": "The guy got stabbed outside my building."}, {"start": 669.86, "end": 670.74, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 670.74, "end": 673.02, "text": "Annie, you gotta get the hell out of that apartment."}, {"start": 673.02, "end": 675.62, "text": "- You don't have to treat me like a kid anymore, remember?"}, {"start": 675.62, "end": 678.9, "text": "- Yeah, but adults still need to be protected."}, {"start": 678.9, "end": 681.16, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 682.26, "end": 683.46, "text": "You're important to me."}, {"start": 686.9, "end": 687.82, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 687.82, "end": 691.82, "text": "- Fear the terror, fear the terror, fear the terror,"}, {"start": 691.82, "end": 693.3, "text": "Norwegian troll."}, {"start": 693.3, "end": 694.86, "text": "- What's going on in here?"}, {"start": 694.86, "end": 697.06, "text": "Here's the terrorizing Troy because he's jealous we moved in together."}, {"start": 697.06, "end": 698.26, "text": "You're the one who's jealous."}, {"start": 698.26, "end": 699.26, "text": "Why would I be jealous?"}, {"start": 699.26, "end": 701.26, "text": "Because you're lonely and crazy."}, {"start": 707.16, "end": 710.46, "text": "Hey guys, this is Toby, our pizza delivery guy,"}, {"start": 710.46, "end": 712.26, "text": "and I know this is gonna sound nuts,"}, {"start": 712.26, "end": 714.86, "text": "but we're in love and we're getting married."}, {"start": 722.36, "end": 724.26, "text": "I wonder what happened all those other timelines."}, {"start": 724.26, "end": 727.5, "text": "Wait, there are other timelines?"}, {"start": 727.5, "end": 729.5, "text": "[buzzer]"}, {"start": 729.5, "end": 730.66, "text": "Ah, OK."}, {"start": 730.66, "end": 733.54, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 733.54, "end": 734.74, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now"}, {"start": 734.74, "end": 735.98, "text": "creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 735.98, "end": 737.22, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 741.98, "end": 743.42, "text": "One, Troy."}, {"start": 743.42, "end": 744.32, "text": "Damn it."}, {"start": 744.32, "end": 746.06, "text": "I'm going to go as fast as I can so I don't miss anything."}, {"start": 750.5, "end": 752.42, "text": "You know who I used to call Miss Anything?"}, {"start": 752.42, "end": 753.3, "text": "Earth of Kittle."}, {"start": 753.3, "end": 754.3, "text": "-Why? -Why?"}, {"start": 754.38, "end": 755.8, "text": "-You're already-- -Totally set up."}, {"start": 756.38, "end": 757.8, "text": "I'm checking on my pies."}, {"start": 758.72, "end": 759.88, "text": "-Facet! -No."}, {"start": 761.14, "end": 762.72, "text": "-Bathroom? -Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 764.14, "end": 766.6, "text": "Jeff, tell us about your father. I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 767.6, "end": 770.14, "text": "-Oh, my God! Are you okay? -I really felt it."}, {"start": 770.22, "end": 771.52, "text": "Let me look it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 773.52, "end": 774.52, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 778.6, "end": 779.6, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 780.24, "end": 781.4, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 781.66, "end": 783.82, "text": "(yelling)"}, {"start": 786.16, "end": 787.5, "text": "- Call number one!"}, {"start": 787.5, "end": 790.16, "text": "Armin, help me stop the bleeding!"}, {"start": 792.16, "end": 793.74, "text": "- I'm dying!"}, {"start": 793.74, "end": 794.74, "text": "I am dying!"}, {"start": 795.7, "end": 796.54, "text": "- Run!"}, {"start": 797.54, "end": 800.88, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 800.88, "end": 801.72, "text": "- Water!"}, {"start": 801.72, "end": 802.54, "text": "- Butter!"}, {"start": 802.54, "end": 803.38, "text": "- Water!"}, {"start": 803.38, "end": 805.54, "text": "(yelling)"}, {"start": 811.66, "end": 813.66, "text": "[all shouting]"}, {"start": 813.66, "end": 815.66, "text": "[all shouting]"}, {"start": 815.66, "end": 817.66, "text": "[all shouting]"}, {"start": 817.66, "end": 819.66, "text": "[buzzer sounds]"}, {"start": 819.66, "end": 821.66, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 821.66, "end": 824.66, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 824.66, "end": 826.66, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 826.66, "end": 828.66, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 835.66, "end": 838.66, "text": "Five. One, two, three, four, five. Abed."}, {"start": 838.66, "end": 839.66, "text": "I'm on it."}, {"start": 839.66, "end": 842.96, "text": "You know who else was on it? And you know what it is."}, {"start": 843.04, "end": 844.66, "text": "Everybody give me money."}, {"start": 844.74, "end": 848.96, "text": "Well, that mascot really softens your personality."}, {"start": 849.04, "end": 851.8, "text": "I banged her with a kid."}, {"start": 851.88, "end": 854.76, "text": "- Fast! - No."}, {"start": 854.84, "end": 857.18, "text": "- Bathroom? - Down the hall."}, {"start": 860.48, "end": 862.6, "text": "I'm being drunk."}, {"start": 862.68, "end": 865.18, "text": "- Oh, my God! Are you okay? - Barely felt it."}, {"start": 865.26, "end": 867.98, "text": "- Let me look at it in the bathroom. - Britta's in the bathroom."}, {"start": 868.06, "end": 869.06, "text": "Um..."}, {"start": 871.86, "end": 873.2, "text": "Oh, no, what happened?"}, {"start": 873.2, "end": 874.7, "text": "The minor head wound."}, {"start": 876.4, "end": 878.7, "text": "Oh, my God. What smells amazing?"}, {"start": 878.7, "end": 880.7, "text": "Oh, someone wants pie!"}, {"start": 881.7, "end": 882.7, "text": "You look a good nurse."}, {"start": 882.7, "end": 883.7, "text": "(giggling)"}, {"start": 886.58, "end": 888.08, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 888.08, "end": 890.34, "text": "They taste just like regular-sized pies."}, {"start": 890.34, "end": 891.74, "text": "Oh, yay!"}, {"start": 891.74, "end": 893.12, "text": "Happy Housewarming."}, {"start": 893.12, "end": 894.12, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 894.72, "end": 895.72, "text": "Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 897.08, "end": 900.08, "text": "Hey, while we're alone, I just want to say thanks for letting me live with you."}, {"start": 900.08, "end": 904.08, "text": "Sometimes I feel like making desserts is the only thing I'm good for in the group."}, {"start": 904.08, "end": 908.08, "text": "But now it's time for me to try making it on my own. Just like you did."}, {"start": 909.08, "end": 911.08, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 911.08, "end": 912.08, "text": "Yeah, I don't think you should open it."}, {"start": 912.08, "end": 914.08, "text": "No, what? What are you talking about?"}, {"start": 914.08, "end": 915.08, "text": "You're very important to me."}, {"start": 916.08, "end": 919.08, "text": "Crap. I was not supposed to eat your stuff. We all made an agreement."}, {"start": 919.08, "end": 923.08, "text": "Crap. I was not supposed to say that out loud. Crap! Okay, cards on the table."}, {"start": 923.08, "end": 925.08, "text": "I'm really high right now."}, {"start": 925.08, "end": 925.92, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 927.26, "end": 929.76, "text": "- Seriously, I want to give you something else."}, {"start": 929.76, "end": 932.72, "text": "A water pick, a speedboat, two water picks."}, {"start": 932.72, "end": 935.8, "text": "- I can't believe I'm feeding my pies to a drug addict."}, {"start": 935.8, "end": 936.64, "text": "- Drug addict?"}, {"start": 936.64, "end": 937.94, "text": "You're a pie pusher."}, {"start": 937.94, "end": 940.36, "text": "You push pies to get love."}, {"start": 940.36, "end": 941.88, "text": "- Give it, Pierce."}, {"start": 941.88, "end": 943.36, "text": "It feels fun."}, {"start": 944.36, "end": 945.44, "text": "- I'm sorry."}, {"start": 945.44, "end": 948.36, "text": "I just had a weird deja vu."}, {"start": 948.36, "end": 949.72, "text": "- You're bad at gift giving."}, {"start": 949.72, "end": 952.14, "text": "- That thing you said about worrying about me?"}, {"start": 952.14, "end": 953.92, "text": "Something my dad always said."}, {"start": 953.92, "end": 955.92, "text": "I demand to be house-worn!"}, {"start": 955.92, "end": 957.92, "text": "Shouldn't have brought it up."}, {"start": 957.92, "end": 959.92, "text": "Just reminded me of my dad."}, {"start": 959.92, "end": 960.92, "text": "Anyway."}, {"start": 960.92, "end": 963.92, "text": "Uh, little make-out 101, less dad talk,"}, {"start": 963.92, "end": 966.92, "text": "and, uh, you could ease up on the bubblegum lip gloss."}, {"start": 966.92, "end": 969.92, "text": "- No, I really-- - No, you!"}, {"start": 969.92, "end": 971.92, "text": "[door opens]"}, {"start": 971.92, "end": 973.92, "text": "Pizza time!"}, {"start": 973.92, "end": 975.92, "text": "Give me this, you godless hippies!"}, {"start": 975.92, "end": 978.92, "text": "You're a sick, sad, twisted old man,"}, {"start": 978.92, "end": 980.92, "text": "and I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 980.92, "end": 982.92, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 983.92, "end": 986.92, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 986.92, "end": 990.92, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 990.92, "end": 992.92, "text": "I gotta say, I hope this is the real one,"}, {"start": 992.92, "end": 994.92, "text": "because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 994.92, "end": 997.92, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 997.92, "end": 999.92, "text": "[ Buzzer ]"}, {"start": 999.92, "end": 1002.92, "text": "Okay. Starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 1002.92, "end": 1003.92, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1003.92, "end": 1005.92, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating"}, {"start": 1005.92, "end": 1006.92, "text": "six different timelines."}, {"start": 1006.92, "end": 1008.92, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 1008.92, "end": 1012.92, "text": "[ Suspenseful music plays ]"}, {"start": 1012.92, "end": 1015.42, "text": "I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1015.42, "end": 1017.92, "text": "Chaos already dominates enough of our lives."}, {"start": 1017.92, "end": 1020.42, "text": "The universe is an endless, raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1020.42, "end": 1022.92, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it, but to weather it together."}, {"start": 1022.92, "end": 1028.42, "text": "On the raft of life, a raft held together by those few, rare, beautiful things that we know to be predictable."}, {"start": 1028.42, "end": 1029.42, "text": "Ropes?"}, {"start": 1029.42, "end": 1030.42, "text": "Fines."}, {"start": 1030.42, "end": 1031.42, "text": "Fines?"}, {"start": 1031.42, "end": 1032.42, "text": "Let him finish!"}, {"start": 1032.42, "end": 1033.42, "text": "Us."}, {"start": 1033.42, "end": 1038.42, "text": "It won't matter what happens to us as long as we stay honest and accepting of each other's flaws and virtues."}, {"start": 1038.42, "end": 1039.92, "text": "Annie will always be driven."}, {"start": 1039.92, "end": 1040.92, "text": "Shirley will always be giving."}, {"start": 1040.92, "end": 1042.18, "text": "Pierce will never apologize."}, {"start": 1042.18, "end": 1043.76, "text": "Britt is sort of a wild card from my perspective."}, {"start": 1043.76, "end": 1046.76, "text": "And Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1046.76, "end": 1047.76, "text": "-I'm egged."}, {"start": 1047.76, "end": 1050.06, "text": "-There are six sides to this die and seven of us."}, {"start": 1050.06, "end": 1052.4, "text": "He divides the system by which he never has to get the pizza."}, {"start": 1052.4, "end": 1055.06, "text": "-Shuff Willie! -Prairie Jackrattle!"}, {"start": 1055.06, "end": 1057.4, "text": "-Dag, man. -Pretty low, dude."}, {"start": 1057.4, "end": 1061.4, "text": "It's called friendship. Look it up and car to it."}, {"start": 1061.4, "end": 1063.4, "text": "-I think we just found our pizza giver."}, {"start": 1063.4, "end": 1065.24, "text": "-Yes, Jeffery! -Yes, we did."}, {"start": 1065.24, "end": 1067.74, "text": "-Good job. -Oh, like it matters who goes."}, {"start": 1067.74, "end": 1069.74, "text": "[ Laughter ]"}, {"start": 1069.74, "end": 1071.74, "text": "- That's so funny. - Karma."}, {"start": 1073.34, "end": 1076.08, "text": "That guy sucks harder than the toilet in an airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1076.16, "end": 1077.58, "text": "Airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1077.66, "end": 1079.04, "text": "Oh, my pies."}, {"start": 1079.7, "end": 1081.04, "text": "- Rocks. - Rocks, yeah."}, {"start": 1081.12, "end": 1082.12, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1082.92, "end": 1085.92, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1087.22, "end": 1090.22, "text": "♪ Those days are all over ♪"}, {"start": 1090.3, "end": 1093.52, "text": "♪ You don't have to send your mother to the night ♪"}, {"start": 1093.6, "end": 1094.48, "text": "Sing, girl!"}, {"start": 1094.56, "end": 1095.48, "text": "♪ Rocks ♪"}, {"start": 1095.56, "end": 1097.14, "text": "I really love your plays."}, {"start": 1097.22, "end": 1097.98, "text": "You should move here."}, {"start": 1098.06, "end": 1103.06, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1103.06, "end": 1105.06, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1105.06, "end": 1107.56, "text": "♪ Go to the jail if it's wrong ♪"}, {"start": 1107.56, "end": 1109.06, "text": "♪ Or if it's right ♪"}, {"start": 1109.06, "end": 1112.56, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1112.56, "end": 1116.24, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1116.24, "end": 1119.74, "text": "- You guys see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1119.74, "end": 1124.08, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1124.08, "end": 1127.58, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1127.58, "end": 1129.52, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1129.52, "end": 1130.52, "text": "- Don't try!"}, {"start": 1130.52, "end": 1131.36, "text": "♪ Roxy ♪"}, {"start": 1131.36, "end": 1133.76, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1133.76, "end": 1134.6, "text": "♪ You lost ♪"}, {"start": 1134.6, "end": 1137.6, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1139.44, "end": 1140.64, "text": "- To Pierce."}, {"start": 1140.64, "end": 1142.74, "text": "May he rest in Pierce."}, {"start": 1142.74, "end": 1144.64, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 1144.64, "end": 1146.8, "text": "- Shirley, don't you think you've had enough?"}, {"start": 1146.8, "end": 1147.64, "text": "- Of you?"}, {"start": 1148.8, "end": 1150.64, "text": "Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.64, "end": 1152.0, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1152.0, "end": 1153.8, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.8, "end": 1156.76, "text": "- Enough with the timeline crap, Abed."}, {"start": 1156.76, "end": 1159.16, "text": "Pierce got shot in the leg and died."}, {"start": 1159.16, "end": 1161.92, "text": "Shirley's a drunk, and he's locked in a mental ward"}, {"start": 1161.92, "end": 1164.08, "text": "because her guilt drove her insane."}, {"start": 1164.08, "end": 1166.24, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1166.24, "end": 1169.78, "text": "Troy lost his larynx because for some dumb reason"}, {"start": 1169.78, "end": 1173.0, "text": "he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1173.0, "end": 1174.68, "text": "- Clearly you don't understand anything"}, {"start": 1174.68, "end": 1175.84, "text": "about the feeding troll."}, {"start": 1175.84, "end": 1179.02, "text": "- Life has gone to hell, Abed."}, {"start": 1179.02, "end": 1180.32, "text": "This is real."}, {"start": 1180.32, "end": 1181.96, "text": "Look at us, look at me."}, {"start": 1181.96, "end": 1185.08, "text": "- Britta, you put one wash away blue streak in your hair,"}, {"start": 1185.08, "end": 1186.98, "text": "And I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1186.98, "end": 1187.98, "text": "Exactly."}, {"start": 1187.98, "end": 1189.18, "text": "Life got dark."}, {"start": 1189.18, "end": 1190.34, "text": "And all because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.34, "end": 1192.5, "text": "Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.5, "end": 1193.5, "text": "It's mine."}, {"start": 1193.5, "end": 1194.96, "text": "I've run through that night over and over in my head,"}, {"start": 1194.96, "end": 1196.5, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.5, "end": 1199.06, "text": "I should have caught the die and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1199.06, "end": 1201.18, "text": "I failed to do that, and we all suffered for it."}, {"start": 1201.18, "end": 1202.54, "text": "But I'm going to make it up to you."}, {"start": 1204.98, "end": 1205.88, "text": "What is this?"}, {"start": 1205.88, "end": 1207.62, "text": "Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest,"}, {"start": 1207.62, "end": 1209.66, "text": "which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.66, "end": 1211.1, "text": "I made us all black goatees out of felt."}, {"start": 1211.1, "end": 1213.1, "text": "I suggest you put them on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1215.08, "end": 1217.34, "text": "From now on, I'm Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1217.34, "end": 1220.46, "text": "We are the evil study group, and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1220.46, "end": 1222.58, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline, the one that I"}, {"start": 1222.58, "end": 1223.9, "text": "stopped you from rolling that die."}, {"start": 1223.9, "end": 1225.36, "text": "Then we destroy the good versions of ourselves"}, {"start": 1225.36, "end": 1228.5, "text": "and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1228.5, "end": 1232.44, "text": "Evil Abed, as evil Jeff, am I allowed to pull fewer punches"}, {"start": 1232.44, "end": 1233.72, "text": "with you? - Certainly."}, {"start": 1233.72, "end": 1234.88, "text": "I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.88, "end": 1236.66, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.66, "end": 1241.04, "text": "I lost my damn arm, and you're making fake beards!"}, {"start": 1241.04, "end": 1241.94, "text": "Go tease."}, {"start": 1241.94, "end": 1244.2, "text": "(groaning)"}, {"start": 1248.38, "end": 1251.12, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1253.38, "end": 1254.72, "text": "Evil Troy and Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1256.56, "end": 1259.32, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1261.32, "end": 1263.5, "text": "- Oh, did they pop it off biscuits?"}, {"start": 1263.5, "end": 1264.32, "text": "- What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1264.32, "end": 1265.16, "text": "- Just in time."}, {"start": 1265.16, "end": 1268.94, "text": "More accurately, we got out just in space."}, {"start": 1268.94, "end": 1271.3, "text": "Well, I certainly walked right into that one, didn't I?"}, {"start": 1271.3, "end": 1273.14, "text": "I guess nothing."}]}